# P5 schedule (relationship-intel-p5). Install at /etc/cron.d/relationship-intel-p5.
# Requires root to place; staged by the builder at
# /home/successbrian/staging/relationship-intel-p5.cron.
#
# P5 field capture loop (new Vera). Hourly:
#   1. p5_missions.py --poll --check-completions  (request side: P4 proposals
#      -> podcast_questions kind='mission' rows; Brian's free_text answers mark
#      missions complete)
#   2. p5_ingest.py --cron  (tesseract OCR -> name/handle extraction ->
#      typed edges into people.social_connections)
#
# Minute 45 chosen: audit of /etc/cron.d on 2026-10-10 showed NO job at :45
# (busiest minutes are :00 with 34 lines and :30 with 12). Staggered per the
# cron-stagger rule; the Hatch-side dumb pipe runs at :35 so uploads land
# before the k11 ingestion pass.

45 * * * * successbrian /home/successbrian/successbrian-os/tools/relationship_intel/p5_hourly.sh
